---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Livart Beauty Academy" description="Privacy policy and data handling guidelines for Livart Beauty Academy.">
	<div class="pt-32 pb-16 px-margin-sm lg:px-margin-lg max-w-[800px] mx-auto text-on-surface">
		<h1 class="font-display-lg text-[48px] tracking-tight mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
		<div class="prose prose-invert prose-p:text-on-surface-variant max-w-none">
			<p>Effective Date: September 2026</p>
			<h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>
			<p>Livart Beauty Academy collects personal information such as your name, contact details, and educational background when you inquire about our courses or submit an admission form. This data is used solely to provide you with relevant academic information.</p>
			<h3>2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
			<p>Your information is used to process your application, communicate course schedules, and provide you with updates regarding academy events. We do not sell your personal data to third-party marketing agencies.</p>
			<h3>3. Data Security</h3>
			<p>We implement standard security measures to protect your information both online and offline. Access to your personal data is restricted to authorized administrative personnel.</p>
			<h3>4. Contact Us</h3>
			<p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at our Edappally campus or via phone at +91 96332 11151.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
